        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Performance container timing]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30336</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30336"/>
        <updated>2026-08-26T18:35:52.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Adds Container Timing to BCD as it's now available (behind a flag) in two browsers: Chrome and Firefox.</p>
<p dir="auto">Spec: <a href="https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/" rel="nofollow">https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/</a></p>
<p dir="auto">IDL:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/#performance-container-timing" rel="nofollow">https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/#performance-container-timing</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/#extensions-to-element" rel="nofollow">https://wicg.github.io/container-timing/#extensions-to-element</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">I've also add <code class="notranslate">containertiming</code> and <code class="notranslate">containertimingignore</code> to the global attributes (as well as <code class="notranslate">elementtiming</code> which I noticed was missing).</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<p dir="auto"><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/container-timing?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/container-timing?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Demo of it working in Firefox when the flag is enabled (which it is not wpt.live):</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/641750003-dd91dbeb-076b-42a1-931c-d6f8eacff161.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..yMxaoO5vNBkPhKV-q9jLJQp6_4Wjlms4PQ7_u8mzKq8"><img width="1392" height="909" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/641750003-dd91dbeb-076b-42a1-931c-d6f8eacff161.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..yMxaoO5vNBkPhKV-q9jLJQp6_4Wjlms4PQ7_u8mzKq8" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 909px;; aspect-ratio: 1392 / 909; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px" class="js-gh-image-fallback"></a>
<p dir="auto">Demo page: <a href="https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/full/ogYvzgQ" rel="nofollow">https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/full/ogYvzgQ</a></p>

<p dir="auto">Chrome:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5110962817073152" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5110962817073152</a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/container-timing-origin-trial" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/container-timing-origin-trial</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Firefox:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940240" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940240</a></li>
</ul>
