        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add new HTML setters and streamers]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30328</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30328"/>
        <updated>2026-08-26T14:38:36.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Chrome 148 shipped the new HTML setters and streaming APIs behind a flag, and we're planning on releasing them unflagged from Chrome 154:<br>
<a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/declarative-partial-updates#renewed_html_insertion_and_streaming_methods" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/declarative-partial-updates#renewed_html_insertion_and_streaming_methods</a></p>
<p dir="auto">I'd like to start adding them to BCD in prep for that, and also to kick off the web features PR.</p>
<p dir="auto">At the moment I've marked most of them as <code class="notranslate">"standard_track": false</code> even though they are going through standardisation because we don't have spec links yet. Will update those when <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5064001077" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12758" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/12758/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12758">whatwg/html#12758</a> lands.</p>
<p dir="auto">I've also corrected <code class="notranslate">setHTMLUnsafe</code> support of <code class="notranslate">options.sanitizer</code> which was included in Chrome 146 (<a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/sanitizer-api/sanitizer-basic-filtering.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">tests showing this</a>). Looks like this was updated incorrectly in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3559661928" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28302" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28302/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28302">#28302</a></p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<p dir="auto"><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/domparsing/tentative?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/domparsing/tentative?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>

<p dir="auto"><a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5054329641893888" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5054329641893888</a></p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

<p dir="auto">Web Feature Issue (WIP): <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4685833491" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4117" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4117/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4117">web-platform-dx/web-features#4117</a></p>
]]></content>
