<p dir="auto">This PR adds a new compatibility entry documenting that <code class="notranslate">writing-mode: vertical-*</code> does not work on <code class="notranslate">&lt;th&gt;</code> or <code class="notranslate">&lt;td&gt;</code> elements on iOS Safari before version 17.</p>
