        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix(api): document multiple ranges in Selection.addRange]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30230</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30230"/>
        <updated>2026-08-13T12:55:17.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Add compatibility data for the Firefox-only behavior of <code class="notranslate">Selection.addRange()</code> supporting multiple selection ranges.</p>
<p dir="auto">The existing <code class="notranslate">Selection.addRange()</code> support data remains unchanged. This adds an <code class="notranslate">adds_multiple_ranges</code> subfeature indicating support in Firefox 51 and later, while marking the behavior as non-standard and unsupported in other browsers.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">npm run lint</code> — passed with 0 errors.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">npm run format</code> — passed; Prettier reported all files correctly formatted and TypeScript produced no errors.</li>
<li>Full unit test suite — <strong>315 tests passed, 0 failed</strong>.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">git diff --check</code> — passed.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The behavior is documented by the Selection API specification and is also reflected in the existing BCD precedent for Firefox-only multiple-range behavior in <code class="notranslate">Selection.getComposedRanges()</code>.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #28742.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3765881012" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28742" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28742/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28742">#28742</a></p>]]></content>
